# RF-12's crowd screening runs (issue #67): about 24 MB a run, almost all of it interactions.jsonl
# and pair_interactions.jsonl. Each run's config.json, outcome.json and events.jsonl ARE tracked
# (the screening numbers come from outcome.json); the runs are deterministic, so the rest is
# rebuilt by running the experiment again (rule-translation.md, section 9).
llm_negotiation/runs/rf12_*/screening/**/interactions.jsonl
llm_negotiation/runs/rf12_*/screening/**/pair_interactions.jsonl
llm_negotiation/runs/rf12_*/screening/**/trajectory.csv
# RF-31's (issue #108), the same way
